EXPLAIN FORMAT=tree SELECT /*+ PQ(t 2) */ * FROM t JOIN t t2 ON t.i = t2.i;
EXPLAIN
-> Inner hash join, one hash table per worker (t2.i = t.i)  (cost=1.7 rows=3)
    -> Table scan on t2  (cost=0.117 rows=3)
    -> Hash
        -> Table scan on t  (cost=0.55 rows=3)

