JOIN t t2 ON t.i = t2.i
JOIN t t3 on t2.i = t3.i
ORDER BY t.i, t2.i, t3.i;
EXPLAIN
-> Sort: t.i, t2.i, t3.i
    -> Stream results  (cost=2.85 rows=3)
