explain format=tree select t1.b from t1 join (select avg(a) from t2 group by a) as sub_2(b) on t1.a = sub_2.b;
EXPLAIN
-> Nested loop inner join  (cost=2396 rows=6652)
    -> Table scan on t1  (cost=67.4 rows=664)
    -> Filter: (t1.a = sub_2.b)  (cost=0.25..2.51 rows=10)
        -> Covering index lookup on sub_2 using <auto_key0> (b=t1.a)  (cost=0.25..2.51 rows=10)
            -> Materialize  (cost=0..0 rows=0)
                -> Table scan on <temporary>
                    -> Aggregate using temporary table
                        -> Table scan on t2  (cost=108 rows=1072)

